# Skill: federation-advisor

## When To Use

Use this before claiming meaningful completion for tasks involving hydrology/physics, ML/evaluation/statistics, scientific claims/writing, or agent/tooling/instruction-layer changes.

## Command

```bash
~/.agent-federation/bin/federation-advisor --cwd "$PWD" "<task or claim>"
```

If the policy says review is required and the wrappers are available:

```bash
~/.agent-federation/bin/federation-advisor --cwd "$PWD" --run "<task or claim>"
```

## Output Handling

Treat Codex/Cursor outputs as advisory evidence. Verify before acting. Do not decide by consensus.

## Safety

Keep reviewer calls read-only. Do not send secrets, credentials, private transcripts, shell history, or unreleased sensitive data.
